      "value": "@{6227bbaf8e19345f3a86a491|full_name}: I'm using Index controllers and I also would love to be able to offset the position (and not just rotation) to how I hold my controllers, so I can make my avatar's hands line up perfectly with IRL.\nSince people (and avatars) have different sized hands being able to change this offset as well would be great for immersion.\nIt also helps a lot with for example sign language when everything lines up.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
